{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/114801","id":3160321300,"node_id":"PR_kwDOAO6SJc68Xq0U","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/114801","diff_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/114801.diff","patch_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/114801.patch","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/114801","commits_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/114801/commits","review_comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/114801/comments","review_comment_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/comments{/number}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/114801/comments","statuses_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/statuses/970aeae3a05128456520688a3aa0767452db88db","number":114801,"state":"closed","locked":false,"title":"GDScript: Don't clean up other scripts","user":{"login":"HolonProduction","id":99511741,"node_id":"U_kgDOBe5tvQ","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/99511741?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/HolonProduction","html_url":"https://github.com/HolonProduction","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HolonProduction/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HolonProduction/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HolonProduction/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HolonProduction/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HolonProduction/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HolonProduction/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HolonProduction/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HolonProduction/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HolonProduction/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"body":"Alternative to https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/114651\r\n\r\nFixes https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/114420\r\nFixes https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/98141 (tested using the 4.3 MRP by myself. Not the original one.)\r\n\r\nMight be related to: https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/95428 -> No MRP, but my hypothesis is, that script members were cleared from a still referenced script.\r\n\r\n---\r\n\r\nhttps://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/114651 tries to fix the logic which cleans up dependencies. This PR in contrast removes the logic completely.\r\n\r\nThis means that GDScripts with cyclic dependencies will only be cleaned up at engine shutdown.\r\n\r\nThe approach is fine, because it's very unlikely for the dependency cleanup logic to run at all, because it is only called from the GDScript destructor. The `GDScriptCache` holds refs to all GDScripts so this destructor never runs until engine shutdown. The only exception are inner classes but they are referenced by their outer class. So for them to get freed an outer script needs to drop a ref to an inner class. This mostly happens in editor when editing scripts.\r\n\r\n<details>\r\n<summary>More verbose rubberducking</summary>\r\n\r\nThis whole cycle detection is located in `GDScript::clear`. There are three possible calls to `clear`\r\n- during `GDScriptLanguage::finalize` -> irrelevant, the whole island detection is protected to not run during language shutdown\r\n- in `GDScript::clear` -> recursion, skip\r\n- in `~GDScript`\r\n\r\nSo for this to run the destructor of a GDScript needs to run. GDScript's are ref counted so the ref count of a GDScript needs to go to 0. `GDScriptCache::full_gdscript_cache` holds a reference to every GDScript.\r\n\r\n(only exception are inner classes those are not referenced by the GDScript cache. But they are referenced by their outer GDScripts).\r\n\r\nSo for the refcount to drop to to 0 one of those things needs to happen:\r\nA. The `GDScriptCache` drops it reference to a gdscript\r\nB. An outer GDScript drops it reference to an inner gdscript\r\n\r\nAbout `A`: this is very unlikely. The only easy way is `GDScriptCache::remove_script` which only gets called from `GDScript::clear` and some unused method. Some edge cases with `take_over_path` might also be able to trigger it I guess.\r\n\r\nB: This can only really happen if the outer script gets destructed (see `A`). It also happens when editing scripts in the script editor. And maybe when messing with `reload` I guess.\r\n\r\nAnd well you can force it with `RefCounted::unreference`.\r\n\r\nAll those possibilities seem so far fetched. So why even bother if all we can safe is some memory from the deps of inner classes. Which will be basically nothing because inner scripts will share most of their deps with their outer class anyway.\r\n</details>","labels":[{"id":73330064,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWw3MzMzMDA2NA==","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/bug","name":"bug","description":"","color":"ff6055","default":true,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":279098082,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwyNzkwOTgwODI=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/topic:gdscript","name":"topic:gdscript","description":"","color":"ffee88","default":false,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null}],"milestone":{"id":12939969,"node_id":"MI_kwDOAO6SJc4AxXLB","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/milestones/23","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/milestone/23","labels_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/milestones/23/labels","number":23,"state":"closed","title":"4.6","description":"","creator":{"login":"Repiteo","id":17489292,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE3NDg5Mjky","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/17489292?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo","html_url":"https://github.com/Repiteo","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/followers","following_url":"https://api